abstract: |
  datadriftR is an R package for detecting concept drift in streaming data,
  providing a suite of online algorithms (DDM, EDDM, HDDM-A, HDDM-W, KSWIN,
  Page-Hinkley, and KL Divergence-based monitoring) with simple R6 interfaces
  suitable for operational monitoring and online learning.
